(c4) RE[O Queen of Heaven rejoice!](f)gí(g)na(f') cae(g)li(h.) *() lae(ixi)tá(h)re,(g'_) al(ixi)le(h')lú(g)ia:(f.) (;) 
Qui[For He whome thou ](f)a(j'_) quem(j) me(k')ru[didst merit to bear,](j)í(ixi')sti(h) por(f')tá(g)re,(h'_) al(ixi)le(h')lú(g)ia:(f.) (:) 
Re[Is risen as He said,](j)sur(j')ré(k)xit,(j'_) sic(j)ut(f') di(g)xit,(f'_) al(g)le(h')lú(ixi)ia:(j.) (;) 
O[Pray for us to God,](j)ra(f) pro(g') no(ixi)bis(h') De(g)um,(f.) al(e)le(g)lú(gg)ia.(f.) (::)
